WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
The four-button target ender leaves Ryu knocked down.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.050
Kimberly advances during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.500
The second dash reaches the throw approach.

4
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.050
Kimberly delays the throw until Ryu is standing.

5
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.250
The throw returns Ryu to knockdown.
